        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://topsailbeachnc.gov/About-Topsail-Beach/History-of-Topsail-Beach"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Missiles and More Museum, housed in the historic Assembly Building, showcases the island’s World War II coastal defense history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
